## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Project Instantiation**: Running `setup-project.sh` or `setup-project.ps1` provisions a new project with the chosen framework (Django, Flutter, React, Vue, WordPress) and configures Graphify, Git hooks, Docker, and AI tool configs automatically.
> - **Graphify Ready-to-Use**: When setup completes, Graphify is fully configured (`.graphifyignore`, skill, tool instructions, post-commit hook) for the generated project.
> - **Modular & Removable**: Graphify can be skipped during setup (`--no-graphify` / `-NoGraphify`) or stripped using `clean-graphify` without impacting any agent or skill features.
> - **Framework Isolation Preserved**: Every framework package (`django/`, `flutter/`, `react/`, `vuejs/`, `wordpress/`) contains its own Graphify skill and configuration templates to remain independently shippable.

